.TH READMAIL 1
.SH NAME
readmail \- POP3 mail reader window
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wm/readmail
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Readmail
is a small Wm-hosted mail client: it connects to a POP3 server,
lists the messages waiting in the mailbox, and displays a selected
message in its own reader window. Errors talking to the server (bad
login, a POP3 protocol problem) are shown in a pop-up dialog rather
than left to standard error.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/wm/readmail.b
